.TH dnsrevenum6 8 2026-02-07 THC IPv6 ATTACK TOOLKIT
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.B dnsrevenum6

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
dnsrevenum6 [-t] dns-server ipv6address

Performs a fast reverse DNS enumeration and is able to cope with slow servers.
Option -t enables TCP instead of UDP (use this if you get many timeouts)
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"

  dnsrevenum6 dns.test.com 2001:db8:42a8::/48
  dnsrevenum6 -t dns.test.com 8.a.2.4.8.b.d.0.1.0.0.2.ip6.arpa
